        "gg8i3zAtl5G_text": "<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Testosterone alone doesn't guarantee lasting longer in the bed or having harder erections nor having more sex desire.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Discover the herbal-drink traditions modern men are finally discovering.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggAKukWiRaA_text": "<strong>2.STAY HARD WITHOUT CONSTANTLY THINKING ABOUT IT</strong>",
        "ggAZyxIPn0b_text": "<p>Last Updated October 29 .2026</p>",
        "ggBfrIs6-eY_text": "<strong>1.HELPS WITH SEX IN THE BEDROOM</strong>",
        "ggBk2pt--b7_text": "<p><strong>THE ANCIENT KING'S APHRODISIAC SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ancient cultures valued herbs associated with sexual desire, fertility, and masculine vitality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew </strong>uses Black Maca, a Peruvian root traditionally consumed for energy and sexual wellness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's what makes it interesting: small human studies suggest Maca may help improve sexual desire without significantly increasing testosterone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Testosterone isn't the only factor influencing your sex drive. That's why Alpha Brew includes Black Maca alongside other botanicals traditionally associated with men's vitality.</p>",
        "ggDkg_ZrnPm_text": "<p><strong>&nbsp;Limited time Up To: 57% OFF + FREESHIPPING&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_s_Golden_Coffee_Retreat_281e232a-9450-4830-b161-93b9379daa4b.png",
