        "ggH0i-8S3kj_text": "<p><strong>THE ANCIENT WARRIOR'S VITALITY SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ancient herbal traditions valued ingredients associated with strength, physical vitality, and endurance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tongkat Ali has a history of traditional use in Southeast Asia, while Shilajit has long been used in Ayurvedic preparations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> combines these ingredients with Arabica coffee.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Energy isn't controlled by testosterone alone. Sleep, nutrition, physical health, and daily habits also influence how energetic you feel.</p>",
        "ggO5LpaV36L_text": "<p><strong>THE ANCIENT BLOOD-FLOW SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Testosterone is important for sexual health, but erections also depend on healthy blood flow.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your blood vessels must relax and allow blood to enter erectile tissue to produce firmness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Traditional Chinese medicine used Horny Goat Weed in preparations associated with male sexual wellness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> combines Horny Goat Weed with L-Citrulline, an amino acid involved in the body's nitric oxide pathway, which helps regulate blood-vessel relaxation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Blood flow is an important part of erectile function that testosterone boosters alone may not address.</p>",
        "ggXHrcwJVLN_text": "<strong>3. ENJOY THE MOMENT WITHOUT FINISHING FAST</strong>",
        "ggZIc3k0bpa_text": "<strong>&nbsp;4. ENERGY THAT LASTS ALL DAY</strong>",
        "gg_wnq9l89h_text": "<strong>By DR. Andrew M.</strong>",
        "ggh66VPTdFf_text": "7 REASONS MEN OVER 50 ARE TURNING TO THE ANCIENT HERBS THAT WERE KEPT SECRET FOR KINGS &nbsp;<br>( AND HIT THE BEDROOM RIGHT AFTER)",
        "ggmhjQvCYG3_text": "<p><strong>THE ROYAL COMPOSURE SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Being able to get hard and being able to control when you finish are two different things.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stress, performance anxiety, and arousal patterns can influence sexual experiences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For centuries, Ashwagandha has been used in Ayurvedic wellness traditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Modern studies suggest certain Ashwagandha extracts may help reduce perceived stress. L-Theanine has also been studied for relaxation-related benefits.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> includes both ingredients.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Feeling calmer may make intimacy more enjoyable, although these ingredients haven't been proven to delay ejaculation.</p>",
